*.sqlite-wal
# Real NoteStore data — never commit. Specifically the SQLite file +
# its WAL/SHM siblings; the .swift source file `NoteStore.swift` is
# tracked and must NOT be matched here. Earlier `NoteStore*` matched
# both, silently dropping all source edits to the SQL queries (DD-241).
NoteStore.sqlite
NoteStore.sqlite-*
NoteStore.db
NoteStore.db-*

# Build output (this repo doesn't ship binaries — paranoia guard)
dist/
out/
